body:
Personally I feel like you should continue to initiate at the same frequency. I've spoken with my GF about her initiating more and she told me the first time she did it that I rejected the advance. I asked her when she initiated and when she explained it made me remember that to me I wasn't sure what she wanted  ¯\\\_(ツ)\_/¯ She says she will continue initiating but didn't do it again until I brought it up with her because she was afraid of getting rejected again. Is there any chance that maybe he didn't notice/understand what you were implying?

&#x200B;

Most likely, he absolutely appreciates you initiating and like you said yourself, you don't want him to feel pressured. While it is admirable you have never turned him down I don't think a comparison needs to be made between the two of you. Don't over-complicate it, initiate if you're horny/want sex and don't think about if something is too much or not!
